Technical Architect &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT NEXGEN CLOUD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NexGen Cloud is a fast-growing GPU cloud and AI infrastructure business. We’re the company behind Hyperstack — a self-serve, on-demand cloud platform built for high-performance AI, HPC, and compute-heavy workloads. Powered by 100% renewable energy and NVIDIA architecture, Hyperstack gives teams from AI startups to enterprise the compute they need, without the cost or complexity of legacy cloud.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We move fast, solve hard problems, and build things that matter. If you want ownership, real impact, and a front-row seat to one of the most consequential infrastructure shifts of the decade — this is the place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE: Technical Architect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re deploying large-scale NVIDIA GPU clusters, including GB200 and GB300 rack-scale systems, into live data centres on tight customer commit dates. On those schedules, a design error found on site costs weeks and real money. We need one architect per deployment who takes the high-level design and turns it into something that can actually be built, then stays with it until the customer signs off.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role for someone who would rather find the problem on paper than on the data hall floor. It suits someone who will push back on an inherited design or a customer requirement that won’t perform, and who carries authority through owning the design rather than managing people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL BE DOING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rather than a checklist, here’s what success in this role actually looks like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take each cluster from CTO handover to customer acceptance as its single design authority, so nothing is ordered or installed against a design you haven’t validated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn high-level designs and initial BOMs into build-ready low-level designs, hall layouts, rack elevations, P2P maps and cable schedules that site teams can build from without having to call you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design the InfiniBand and Ethernet fabric, power, direct liquid cooling and containment to fit the real constraints of each data centre&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate every BOM before it goes to procurement, and make part substitution calls knowing exactly what breaks when a line changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold OEMs and integrators (NVIDIA, Dell, Lenovo, Supermicro and others) to their technical commitments, from FAT witness through to on-site issue resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the reference designs and building blocks that mean each new deployment starts from a known-good baseline rather than a blank page&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We care more about how you think and work than a perfect CV. You’ll likely bring a combination of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Essential:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve designed and delivered large-scale GPU or HPC clusters into live data centres, and you were on site for the build&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, practical knowledge of NVIDIA platforms (GB200/GB300 rack-scale and HGX H200/B200) and what each one demands of a facility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cluster-scale InfiniBand and Ethernet fabric design: topology, rail optimisation, oversubscription, and cable and optic selection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Physical infrastructure design across power and redundancy, direct liquid cooling and CDUs, containment and achievable cable lengths&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know part numbers, what’s optional and what isn’t, and you can hold an OEM to account when their commitments slip&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Factory integration and FAT experience, including holding a dispatch gate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Storage design for AI workloads (WEKA, VAST, DDN, Ceph or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deployments across multiple geographies and data centre operators, including sites requiring fit-out&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Neocloud or hyperscale experience on compressed schedules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and annual discretionary bonus scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee wellbeing benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday, plus public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced Pension Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working arrangements (remote or hybrid, depending on role and location)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real ownership and autonomy — the trust to take initiative and experiment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visible, meaningful impact as we scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear career progression in a high-growth company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, international culture built on trust, transparency, and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to help shape NexGen Cloud’s team, culture, and future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY APPLY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from all backgrounds. If you enjoy solving complex infrastructure problems and want to build something meaningful at scale, we’d like to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MORE INFORMATION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nexgencloud.com/careers&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about us or follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/nexgen-cloud&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/CloudNexgen&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our journey and keep up with our latest news and releases.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Infrastructure Delivery  London

Global Account Executive at SetSales &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Are you someone who thrives in a fast-paced environment, where you are given the autonomy and support to handle large amounts of responsibility?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Are you looking for the opportunity to accelerate your sales career whilst also being surrounded by an exceptional entrepreneurial team with motivated and extremely driven people?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be responsible for managing and growing a portfolio of sponsors across our international conferences, building long-term relationships with senior decision-makers and driving sponsorship revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-performance B2B sales role with a strong focus on sponsor retention, renewals and account growth, alongside identifying and closing new sponsorship opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a commercially driven salesperson who enjoys building strong client relationships, growing accounts and consistently delivering against revenue targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You should have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At least 2 years of B2B sales experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A proven track record of achieving or exceeding individual revenue targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience managing client relationships, retaining customers and identifying opportunities to grow existing accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Confidence engaging, pitching and negotiating with senior decision-makers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong commercial instincts and the ability to identify new revenue opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ambition, resilience and ownership – you take responsibility for your portfolio, performance and results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication and relationship-building skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;This role might not be the right fit if...&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You prefer a role focused purely on relationship management, without responsibility for sales and revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t enjoy negotiating, closing deals and working towards commercial targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re not comfortable taking ownership of client relationships and proactively identifying opportunities to grow accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re looking for a hybrid or remote position – our London team works together from the office five days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage and retain sponsors:&lt;/strong&gt; Build strong, long-term relationships with an existing portfolio of sponsors, driving renewals and repeat business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow existing accounts:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify opportunities to upsell, cross-sell and increase sponsorship revenue within your portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive new business:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify, pitch and close new sponsorship opportunities to expand our client base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own your revenue targets:&lt;/strong&gt; Take responsibility for achieving ambitious individual sales and retention targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver exceptional partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with our content and delivery teams to ensure sponsors receive a high-quality experience and see value in their partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Competitive salary and market-leading OTE.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Significant ownership and responsibility from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The opportunity to work closely with our senior leadership team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;International travel to our conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Training, coaching and ongoing development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong opportunities for internal progression as we continue to grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SetSales is a leading Northern European sales community connecting sales leaders, commercial executives and ambitious professionals. Through our conferences and events, we bring together decision-makers from across industries to share insights, build networks and explore the future of sales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SetSales is part of United Media, a global B2B media and conferences group.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start date:&lt;/strong&gt; As soon as possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monday–Friday, we work from our &lt;strong&gt;WeWork office in Victoria, London&lt;/strong&gt;. Due to the collaborative nature of our work, we do not offer remote work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You must have the &lt;strong&gt;right to work in the UK&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Sales  London

Senior Software Engineer - Distributed Systems &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Distributed Systems engineers at Datadog design, implement and run in production the foundational platforms powering our applications. Your data pipelines will ingest, store, analyze and query in real-time billions of events per second from companies all over the globe. The platforms are optimized for durability, high availability, low latency, internet-scale footprint and operability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships that it builds, the creativity it brings to the table, and the collaboration of being together. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our employees can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Build fault-tolerant, horizontally scalable solutions running in multi-tenant environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Write in Go, Java, Rust or C++, amongst other languages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Use Kafka, Redis, Cassandra, Elasticsearch and other open-source components&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Own meaningful parts of our service, have an impact, grow with the company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You have a BS/MS/PhD in a scientific field or equivalent experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You have significant backend programming experience in one or more languages (Go, Java, Rust, C++)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You have been exposed to working on problems (high durability / low latency /…)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You can get down to the low-level when needed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You care about simple designs and performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You want to work in a fast, high-growth startup environment that respects its engineers and customers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;You’re excited about leveraging AI tools to enhance how you code, solve problems, and build – or eager to learn how&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;You have demonstrated ability to use AI coding tools in day-to-day workflows and validate, critique, and refine AI-generated output&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Bonus: You’re motivated to push the boundaries of how AI can improve software engineering best practices and contribute to building AI-enabled products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Growth:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;New hire stock equity (RSUs) and employee stock purchase plan (ESPP)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Continuous professional development, product training, and career pathing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Intradepartmental mentor and buddy program for in-house networking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;An inclusive company culture, ability to join our Community Guilds (Datadog employee resource groups)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to Inclusion Talks, our Internal panel discussions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Free, global mental health benefits for employees and dependents age 6+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive global benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits and Growth listed above may vary based on the country of your employment and the nature of your employment with Datadog.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: white;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;215&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity at Datadog:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is proud to offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;equal employment opportunity&lt;/a&gt; to everyone regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, veteran status, and other characteristics protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. Here are our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/candidate-legal-notices/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Legal Notices&lt;/a&gt; for your reference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog endeavors to make our Careers Page accessible to all users. If you would like to contact us regarding the accessibility of our website or need assistance completing the application process, please complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeoJeduEZ2NdZF_65uZmWUrCM-zee7yADXX1s6Xr9zAGq8iKA/viewform&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. This form is for accommodation requests only and cannot be used to inquire about the status of applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Privacy and AI Guidelines:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Dev Eng  Bordeaux; Grenoble; Lyon; Montpellier; Nantes; Paris; Sophia Antipolis

Lead Designer &lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Designer (FDE)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Paris, France (hybrid, three days a week in the office)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team: UX Team (FDE)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary: €63,000 - €75,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contract: Permanent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting To: Head of User Experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note: This role requires an existing right to work in France. We can’t offer visa sponsorship, but we review sponsorship role by role, so keep an eye on our careers site for future opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;About Kaluza&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today’s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own UX strategy for our EU programme end to end, with real judgement over what to prioritise and how, as the market and the team&#39;s shape itself still takes form&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with Product, Engineering, and Data on the ground locally, including wider teams and client-side engineers,bringing user needs into decisions from the start, not added on afterward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use our established research methods to bring real insight into your own design work, and feed what you learn locally back into the wider team&#39;s shared understanding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and grow two designers based in London, building one genuinely connected team across EU and the UK from early on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape how local work becomes part of our shared platform and design system, so what you build here compounds for every client after, not just this one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build directly in code where useful, using AI-assisted tools to prototype or ship small front-end changes yourself, closing the gap between design and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Go beyond representing UX, be an active voice in the trade-offs between PMs and Design, holding the right balance between client-specific needs and our global approach, including directly with clients and stakeholders in workshops, showcases, and pre-sales conversations across the EU market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define what design leadership looks like across a genuinely distributed function, UK, EU, and Australia, while it&#39;s still being built&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ideally you’ll have/be&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record owning UX strategy and delivery end to end for a complex, multi-stakeholder product, ideally in a regulated or operationally complex industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing in B2B or B2B2C environments, for professional, repeat users rather than casual consumers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience managing or mentoring other designers, comfortable leading a small team while still doing hands-on design work yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working from, and contributing back to, a shared platform or design system, not just consuming one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working close to code, confident using AI-assisted development tools (such as Claude Code) to go from design to a working interface yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine appetite for building something from an early stage, comfortable with ambiguity that comes with shaping a team and a market presence, not just operating inside one already settled&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you&#39;ll work&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We offer flexible working, with an expectation of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to win:&lt;/strong&gt; Collective pride in decarbonising energy at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve the real problem:&lt;/strong&gt; Cutting through complexity to focus on real-world outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build trust every day:&lt;/strong&gt; Consistency, transparency and doing what we say.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the outcome:&lt;/strong&gt; Full accountability, wins and setbacks, without ego.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go further together: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaboration, respect and different perspectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial &amp;amp; Insurance: &lt;/strong&gt;Discretionary bonus, Alan Mutuelle Health Insurance, x3 Life &amp;amp; Death insurance (Prévoyance) via Alan, and standard Sécurité Sociale contributions (pension, family allowance, unemployment insurance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Allowances:&lt;/strong&gt; 50% commuting expense reimbursement, €200 Home Working Allowance, and €150 Learning Fund&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; 25 days holiday + bank holidays + RTT days, Moments That Matter Leave, Compassionate Leave, two paid Volunteering Days, Flexible Working, and Career Break eligibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come as you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to meet people from all walks of life. The more inclusive we are, the better our work will be, and we recognise talent on merit and potential. If you’re excited about the role but don’t tick every box, we’d still love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/careers/&quot;&gt; careers page&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;. Our Applicant Data Protection Policy is&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/applicant-data-protection-notice/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Product  Paris, Paris

Senior Specialist II, Talent Acquisition &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At ASM, we are shaping the future of semiconductor manufacturing through innovation and technology leadership. Our success depends on attracting and hiring exceptional talent across engineering, commercial, service, and leadership functions. We are seeking a highly experienced Senior Talent Acquisition Specialist to join our European Talent Acquisition team and serve as a trusted advisor to senior business leaders across Europe and North America.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a Senior Talent Acquisition Specialist, you will lead the end-to-end recruitment of experienced professionals and senior leaders across multiple business functions and geographies. This is a highly visible role requiring exceptional stakeholder management, market intelligence, and proactive sourcing capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will partner closely with senior leaders to identify, attract, and secure top talent in a highly competitive semiconductor market. Success in this role requires a strong executive presence, the ability to influence at all levels, and a proactive, data-driven approach to talent acquisition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role is based in Almere and will serve as a key Talent Acquisition partner supporting hiring across Europe and the United States.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;5&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead end-to-end recruitment processes for experienced, senior, and executive-level positions across Europe and North America.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;5&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Develop and execute innovative sourcing strategies to identify and engage passive talent across highly competitive industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;5&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Enable ASM’s long-term business strategy by shaping future-focused talent pipelines, recruiting for emerging organizational capabilities, and partnering with leaders to anticipate workforce needs in a rapidly evolving industry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;5&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to senior leaders and hiring managers, providing market insights, talent intelligence, and strategic hiring recommendations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
